I hear Nina travelled
around Europe for a while


01:20:43.722 --> 01:20:46.962
and eventually got a job
at a fancy restaurant in Rome.


01:20:47.121 --> 01:20:51.082
This year, her parents are going to
visit her for Thanksgiving.


01:20:57.200 --> 01:20:58.848
I'm not saying
what happened last Christmas


01:20:59.000 --> 01:21:01.084
happened solely
because of Nina.


01:21:02.440 --> 01:21:05.888
I'm saying maybe what happened
needed to happen,


01:21:06.040 --> 01:21:08.364
even for me.


01:21:10.920 --> 01:21:12.644
- Ah!
- Whoa! Whoa!


01:21:12.800 --> 01:21:14.687
My dad came into the city
the other day


01:21:14.840 --> 01:21:16.640
to celebrate my new job.


01:21:17.799 --> 01:21:20.320
He told me he offered the house
to my mom but...


01:21:20.480 --> 01:21:21.963
...she didn't want it.


01:21:22.120 --> 01:21:25.840
He thought about selling
but decided to hold onto it


01:21:25.999 --> 01:21:27.482
for when Toby and I
come visit.


01:21:27.639 --> 01:21:30.279
He's still
figuring things out.


01:21:30.439 --> 01:21:33.886
But, luckily, he has
his best friend to help with that.


01:22:54.354 --> 01:22:57.801
# I saw you, I found you


01:22:57.954 --> 01:23:01.281
# I watched you grow


01:23:01.433 --> 01:23:04.281
# Slowly but surely


01:23:04.434 --> 01:23:08.514
# We ebb and we ﬂow


01:23:08.673 --> 01:23:12.001
# I felt a change


01:23:12.152 --> 01:23:15.557
# Deep in my bones


01:23:15.712 --> 01:23:20.437
# Something new


01:23:20.592 --> 01:23:22.633
# Has grown


01:23:28.232 --> 01:23:31.559
# I was inside waiting


01:23:31.712 --> 01:23:35.159
# Eyes open wide


01:23:35.311 --> 01:23:40.996
# I felt the ground beneath me wake


01:23:42.431 --> 01:23:45.836
# I felt a change


01:23:45.991 --> 01:23:49.439
# Deep in my bones


01:23:49.590 --> 01:23:55.155
# Something new


01:23:55.311 --> 01:23:57.394
# Has grown


01:24:10.829 --> 01:24:13.349
# Up in your room


01:24:13.509 --> 01:24:17.874
# Was a great silent storm


01:24:18.029 --> 01:24:19.273
# Clouds have cleared


01:24:19.429 --> 01:24:23.913
# The air was sweet and warm. #

